      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, I agree. Not necessary for Forced, but I'm not against it, since it's rarely needed over Dynamic but Dynamic 100% should stay there once enabled. Keep \"off\" for Default Setting though.\n\nOccasionally, you'll come across worlds that look weird on Dynamic and even more rarely ones that look really broken on Forced. But it never stopped me from turning the Setting off if necessary.\n\nEven if it did somehow \"crash\" you and stopped you from being able to get into VR again (don't see how or believe this could happen at all - but saying just in case), you can delete the settings file in your VRChat folder on your PC to reset back to Default settings so shrug.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
